      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} This post was changed to \"available in future release\", and the identifier of 22549 was changed to `user::Status`. But we can't see the split new one `subscription::Status` on Crowdwin.\n\nI understand the Canny status  \"available in future release\" means \"The team completed the modifications and is waiting for the next update for shipping.\" So I'm a bit confused. Do I have to simply wait for the addition, or did some mistake in the workflow happen?",
